OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FThe Queen has spoken about the
OL,7,Fdifficulty she faced keeping the
OL,8,FKing's cancer diagnosis secret while
OL,9,Fcarrying out public engagements,
OL,10,Fbefore it was announced to the rest of
OL,11,Fthe world.
OL,13,FCamilla visited a Maggie's cancer
OL,14,Fsupport centre in 2024 when she knew
OL,15,Fof Charles's diagnosis, just days
OL,16,Fbefore the news was officially
OL,17,Fdisclosed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
