OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787102285
OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FIn a short film made in collaboration
OL,7,Fbetween Buckingham Palace and Maggie's
OL,8,Fto mark the charity's 30th
OL,9,Fanniversary, she revealed her feelings
OL,10,Fabout having to deal privately with
OL,11,Fthe challenging news about her
OL,12,Fhusband's health.
OL,14,FThe Queen described "longing to let it
OL,15,Fout", saying "obviously I couldn't"
OL,16,Fand called the experience two years
OL,17,Fago "quite difficult".
OL,19,FShe revealed she "almost said
OL,20,Fsomething" but felt the time was not
OL,21,Fright.
OL,26,@vD@UOUwD@DO]wD@NOUwD@cO]yD@EOUyD@UO]{D@
OL,26,AROU|D@JO]
