OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787102285
OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FCamilla also spoke of helping to look
OL,7,Fafter her "poor husband" but recalled
OL,8,Fhow the King ploughed on after his
OL,9,Fdiagnosis as his way of coping.
OL,11,F"Nothing stopped him. He just said
OL,12,F'This is my way. I'm going to cope
OL,13,Fwith it'," she said.
OL,15,FMaggie's chief executive Dame Laura
OL,16,FLee, who was filmed in conversation
OL,17,Fwith Camilla at Clarence House,
OL,18,Fpraised the Queen for her courage
OL,19,Fduring the 2024 engagement.
OL,26,@oD@KOUoD@XO]sD@AOUuD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
