OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FCamilla, who is president of Maggie's,
OL,7,Fofficially launched its new centre at
OL,8,Fthe Royal Free Hospital in London on
OL,9,FJanuary 31 2024, while the King was
OL,10,Frecovering from treatment for an
OL,11,Fenlarged prostate.
OL,13,FIt was revealed in the film that
OL,14,FCharles had, by that time, already
OL,15,Fbeen diagnosed with an undisclosed
OL,16,Fform of cancer, with the news being
OL,17,Fannounced to the nation by the palace
OL,18,Ffive days later on February 5.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
