CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787102285
OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FThe health of the 77-year-old monarch,
OL,7,Fwho is still receiving cancer
OL,8,Ftreatment, is said to be continuing in
OL,9,Fa very positive direction, with
OL,10,FCharles announcing the "personal
OL,11,Fblessing" at the end of last year that
OL,12,Fhis schedule of treatment was being
OL,13,Freduced.
OL,15,FThe Queen said: "I remember coming to
OL,16,Fsee a Maggie's just after the King
OL,17,Fbeing diagnosed.
OL,19,F"Nobody could say anything at the
OL,20,Ftime. That was quite difficult.
OL,26,@rD@XOUsD@IO]wD@QOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787102285
OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,F"I almost said something but, you
OL,7,Fknow, I felt that it wasn't the time
OL,8,Fto say.
OL,10,F"(I) looked at everybody who was
OL,11,Fsuffering and all the relations and I
OL,12,Fthink it made me realise even more how
OL,13,Fimportant these places were."
OL,15,FDame Laura told the Queen: "It was
OL,16,Fjust a week before it became public
OL,17,Fand the courage that must have taken
OL,18,Ffor you..."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUuD@]O]wD@\OUzD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
