CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787102285
OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FCamilla replied: "Well it wasn't... I
OL,7,Fwas just longing to let it out but
OL,8,Fobviously I couldn't."
OL,10,FShe spoke about talking to visitors at
OL,11,Fthe centre during the engagement: "I
OL,12,Fwas almost questioning them. I didn't
OL,13,Fwant to pry too deeply.
OL,15,F"But normally when I went in, I was
OL,16,Fjust talking to them, but I don't
OL,17,Fknow, I felt it was much more deep."
OL,26,@nD@ROUpD@VO]sD@cOUwD@AOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
