FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787102285
OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FDame Laura talked about the number of
OL,7,Fpeople who had been coming to its
OL,8,Fcentres because of the King being open
OL,9,Fand continuing to have a productive
OL,10,Flife, and that Maggie's had seen a 12%
OL,11,Fincrease in men visiting.
OL,13,FCharles returned to public-facing
OL,14,Fengagements in April 2024, less than
OL,15,Fthree months after his treatment began.
OL,17,FHe is known for being a workaholic,
OL,18,Fand the Queen has spoken before of how
OL,19,Fhe "won't slow down and won't do what
OL,20,Fhe's told" even after his diagnosis.
OL,26,@{D@DOU|D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
