OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787102285
OL,3,CQueen reveals anguish at keeping
OL,4,CKing's cancer secret
OL,6,FDame Laura described Camilla, who has
OL,7,Fbeen president of the charity since
OL,8,F2008, as speaking "powerfully of her
OL,9,Fown emotions" and displaying her
OL,10,F"natural response" as a wife, as the
OL,11,Fchief executive also praised the King
OL,12,Ffor his openness.
OL,14,FMaggie's has 27 centres across the UK,
OL,15,Fbuilt in the grounds of major NHS
OL,16,Fcancer hospitals, and supports
OL,17,Fhundreds of thousands of people each
OL,18,Fyear.
